<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Set up DALOY</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="<?=e(asset_url('app.css'))?>"><body class="login-body"><main class="setup card"><div class="brand-mark">D</div><h1>Welcome to DALOY</h1><p>The application needs its database before you can sign in.</p><ol><li>Start MySQL in the XAMPP Control Panel.</li><li>Copy <code>config.example.php</code> to <code>config.local.php</code> and configure your database connection.</li><li>Run <code>C:\xampp\php\php.exe bin\install.php</code> from the project folder.</li><li>Sign in using the temporary credentials printed by the installer.</li></ol><p>See README.md for installation, optional demo data, backup, and deployment instructions.</p><a class="button primary" href="./">Check connection</a></main></body></html>
